{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01892","headline":"杂曲歌辞 独不见 · 沈佺期","name":"杂曲歌辞 独不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卢家小妇郁金堂，海燕双栖玳瑁梁。\n九月寒砧催下叶，十年征戍忆辽阳。\n白狼河北音书断，丹凤城南秋夜长。\n谁知含愁独不见，使妾明月照流黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}